  "prefLabel": "Alc 103.06 Public Access to Minutes",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Alc 103.06 Public Access to Minutes.\n\n(a) Minutes of board actions which are not exempt from disclosure under RSA 91-A:3, III or RSA 91-A:5 shall be public records.\n\n(b) Pursuant to RSA 91-A:2, II and RSA 91-A:3, III, the minutes shall be available for inspection during the office of professional licensure and certification’s (OPLC)ordinary office hours .\n\nSource. #8169, eff 9-21-04; ss by 9417, eff 3-14-09 (from Alc 103.07); ss by #14585, eff 6-1-26",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/alc100-500.html"
